title: WindowNPCChat
---
Stranger: Hey! You okay?...
Stranger: Look — my car broke down back there. Any chance of a lift? Looks like you need someone to keep you awake.
-> {$PlayerName}: Let me call the police, they can help you.
    <<CallPolice>>
-> {$PlayerName}: Sorry, I can't. Hope you find help.
    <<DriveOff>>
===

title: PoliceCall
---
Officer: Highgate police, what's your emergency?
{$PlayerName}: Hi, I'm on the country road — someone's car has broken down.
Officer: Thank you for calling. We'll send someone to your phones current location.
Officer: One more thing — we've had reports of a violent individual in that area tonight. Please stay safe.
===

title: AfterPoliceCall
---
-> {$PlayerName}: Help is coming. They mentioned reports of someone dangerous nearby...
    Stranger: ... That's scary. Maybe you should stay and keep me company?
-> {$PlayerName}: Someone's on their way, stay here.
    Stranger: Kinda creepy out here, wish you'd keep me company...
    -> {$PlayerName}: ...
<<NpcWalksAway>>
===